	(text "MAX17048 FUEL GAUGE\n\nI2C ADDRESS 0x36\nNO SENSE RESISTOR\n\nNEVER BENCH VALIDATED ON AQROOT\nBETA BRING-UP REQUIRED\n\nVERIFY:\nCELL VOLTAGE\nSOC PLAUSIBILITY\nHIBERNATE\nBATTERY INSERTION / REMOVAL\nNO I2C BACKPOWER DURING +3V3 HARD-OFF\n\nFOOTPRINT PENDING EXACT ADI LAND-PATTERN REVIEW\nDO NOT ROUTE UNTIL FOOTPRINT APPROVED"
