	(text "REVERSE-POLARITY PROTECTION - IMPLEMENTED (FBV2-S1)\nD-050 / D-052 / D-064 / D-068. The placeholder is RETIRED.\n\nSee block A, lower left, for the captured circuit:\nBAT_CONNECTOR_P -> F1 -> BAT_RAW -> Q2 -> BAT_MID -> Q3\n-> BAT_SENSE -> R75 15mR -> BAT_PROTECTED_P -> U11 BAT\nController U18 LTC4368-1. Recovery branch in block B.\n\nBAT_CONNECTOR_P AND BAT_PROTECTED_P\nREMAIN INTENTIONALLY DISTINCT NETS.\n\nSTATUS: CAPTURED AND ERC-CHECKED.\nNOT FABRICATION READY. NO PLACEMENT, NO ROUTING.\nFOOTPRINT AUDIT AND VALUE-TO-VERIFY ITEMS OPEN (FBV2-S2)."
