		(property "Description" "3 uA 1-cell Li+/Li-Po fuel gauge with ModelGauge algorithm; reports state-of-charge and cell voltage with no sense resistor, programmable low-SOC alert; I2C 7-bit slave address 0x36 (0x6C write / 0x6D read); 8-pin TDFN-EP (G package)"
