		(property "Package" "8-pin TDFN-EP, 2 mm x 2 mm, 0.5 mm pitch, with exposed pad; Maxim/ADI package code T822+3, outline drawing 21-0168, land pattern 90-0065"
			(at 115.57 82.55 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Note" "Footprint left blank intentionally: datasheet 19-6171 Rev 7 (11/16) references outline 21-0168 and land pattern 90-0065 as external documents and does not give TDFN exposed-pad dimensions, so no KiCad DFN-8 2x2mm P0.5mm variant could be verified against the G-package drawing. Pin 9 is a KiCad-only logical number for the unnumbered exposed pad (datasheet lists EP as '--'). CTG (pin 1) is typed passive: datasheet function is 'Connect to Ground', a strap pin, not a supply input. ALRT (pin 5) is an active-low open-drain output, shown as ~{ALRT}."
			(at 115.57 82.55 0)
