		(property "Note" "Wurth datasheet for 74438357010 (WE-MAPI 4030): 1 uH +/-20%; RDC 11.6 mOhm typ / 13.5 max; Isat 6.2 A (10% drop) / 12.5 A (30%); IRP,40K 10.25 A max; fres 59 MHz. Body 4.1 x 4.1 mm +/-0.2, height 3.1 mm max. Marked with start-of-winding. These ratings supersede the earlier 'take from datasheet' placeholder and satisfy the outstanding check that L2 be rated for the TI TPS61023 5V boost. FOOTPRINT STILL BLOCKED: recommended land pattern prints 1.39 / 3.35 / 3.7 mm but which is the span is not recoverable from text; prefer Wurth's own EDA/KiCad asset."
