		(property "Note" "Coilcraft doc 745-1 rev 03/10/26: 1.5 uH +/-20%; DCR 14.40 mOhm typ / 15.80 max; SRF 59 MHz typ; Isat 4.1 A (10% drop) / 4.4 A (20%) / 4.6 A (30%); Irms 6.7 A (20K rise) / 9.1 A (40K). Body 4.0 x 4.0 mm +/-0.3, height 2.10 mm max, terminals 0.82 x 1.57 mm. LCSC C3033018. Coilcraft marks the start (short) lead - connect high dv/dt there for lowest EMI; the footprint must carry that orientation marker. FOOTPRINT STILL BLOCKED: the recommended land pattern prints 0.98 / 2.37 / 3.4 mm but text extraction does not reveal which dimension is the span, so pad centres cannot be fixed without reading the drawing."
