	(text "LTC4368-1 ONLY (the -2 trips at -3 mV and blocks charging). RETRY grounded = latch-off; SHDN toggled low-then-high clears it. UV unused: 510k to VIN per datasheet (V_UV/V_OV = 492.5 / 500 / 507.5 mV, hysteresis 20 / 25 / 32 mV).\nOV TRIP (P-21, D-104): R77 3.65M / R78 442k -> 4.63 V nominal, 4.48-4.78 V over comparator + 1% resistor tolerance. Release 4.40 V nominal. Above a 4.35 V-class pack, well below the 5.05 V first capture."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 239.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "563d13ca-5456-8343-ff56-1cdfbcaaa0d2")
	)
